# A) Lending fee fix — 2-minute surgical diff

## A.1 — `api/billing.js`: kill the 8% principal shave

```diff
--- a/api/billing.js
+++ b/api/billing.js
@@ function chargePlatformFee(businessId, amount, kind, meta = {}) {
   const rate =
     kind === 'txn'     ? plan.txnFeePct / 100 :
     kind === 'escrow'  ? plan.escrowFeePct / 100 :
-    kind === 'loan'    ? 0.08 :
+    kind === 'loan'    ? 0.02 :   // 2% origination, earned once, disclosed
